# Cyber Essentials / Secure Configuration — baseline HTTP security headers.
# Applied by Netlify / Cloudflare Pages from the publish directory.
# Add a tuned Content-Security-Policy per app (Report-Only first). See
# docs/security/cyber-essentials.md.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: interest-cohort=(), browsing-topics=()
  X-XSS-Protection: 0
